From 301348f725946df1baf22a07d618518a79ba6b3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cunninghamcard-bit
 <269104167+cunninghamcard-bit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 17:26:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] contacts/tracking: Retain lost contacts for a few frames

On some devices a contact is regularly not detected for a single frame
during swipes. The tracker dropped it immediately, so the daemon lifted
the touch and the next frame started a new one.

Add the RetainFrames and RetainDistance options. Contacts that were not
detected are kept with their last state for up to RetainFrames frames,
and are picked up again by a new detection within RetainDistance. A real
lift is reported RetainFrames frames later. The feature is disabled by
default.

The matching loop now stops at the first infinite distance, which gives
the same result as before when no contacts are retained.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 etc/iptsd.conf                    | 13 ++++++
 src/contacts/config.hpp           |  4 ++
 src/contacts/finder.hpp           |  3 +-
 src/contacts/tracking/config.hpp  | 45 +++++++++++++++++++++
 src/contacts/tracking/tracker.hpp | 67 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 src/core/generic/config.hpp       |  6 +++
 src/core/linux/config-loader.hpp  |  2 +
 7 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/contacts/tracking/config.hpp

diff --git a/etc/iptsd.conf b/etc/iptsd.conf
index 140fb2b..06b5389 100644
--- a/etc/iptsd.conf
+++ b/etc/iptsd.conf
@@ -131,6 +131,19 @@
 ##
 # OrientationThresholdMax = 5
 
+##
+## For how many frames a contact is kept alive after it was not detected anymore.
+## Touches that fade out for a frame or two (e.g. during fast swipes) are not interrupted,
+## but lifting a finger is reported this many frames later. Set to 0 to disable.
+##
+# RetainFrames = 0
+
+##
+## How many centimeters a contact may move while it is not detected and still be
+## recognized as the same contact.
+##
+# RetainDistance = 2
+
 ##
 ## The minimal diameter a contact must have.
 ##
